flowchart TD
    A[Order received] --> B{Payment valid?}
    B -->|No| C[Notify customer]
    B -->|Yes| D[Reserve inventory]

    subgraph Zürich Fulfillment Center
        D --> E[Pick items]
        E --> F[Pack shipment]
        F --> G[(Print label)]
    end

    G --> H{Fragile items?}
    H -->|Yes| I["Add 'Fragile' sticker"]
    H -->|No| J[Hand off to carrier]
    I --> J
    J --> K[Update tracking status]
    C --> L[Close order]
    K --> L
